  "content": "[Intro]\n[Am7]\n[Fmaj7/A]\n[C]\n[G]\n[Am7]\n[Fmaj7/A]\n[C]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Am7]Sitting by the telephone,\n[Fmaj7/A]Waiting for you to come\n[C]home, And I know\n[G]it won’t be soon, And I know\n[Am7]your views were different to mine,\n[Fmaj7/A]But I loved\n[C]you more than I loved\n[G]my own life. And you see,\n[Am7]I cannot\n[Fmaj7/A]be, without\n[C]you, with-\n[G]out you.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[C5]So let’s not pre-\ntend that everything’s fine,\n[G5]We both\nknow I get drunk on wine,\n[F5]More than\nI should do,\n[C5]More than\nI should do with you.\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cmaj7]We sit on\npark benches till the morn,\n[G6]Talking about\nshit that we can’t afford\n[Cmaj7/F]more than\nwe should do\n[Cmaj7]More than\nwe should do\nAnd when the\nrain comes pouring down\n[G6]We'll find\nthe shelter in the nearest\n[Cmaj7/F]town Cause that's\nwhat we do\n[Cmaj7]Cause that's\nwhat we do\n\n[Outro]\n[Am7]\n[Fmaj7/A]\n[C]\n[G]\n[Am7]\n[Fmaj7/A]\n[C]\n[G]\n[Am7]",
